        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "This addresses someone with a strong reaction. It can reproach them or express playful surprise among close people; it is not a neutral way to praise a stranger.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "好你个姐姐，你也知道这件事，为什么没告诉我？",
